WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.701
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:04.971
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.839
President Biden
last night delivered

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:09.042
his first
State of the Union address

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.578
and Chuck Schumer could not
figure out when to clap.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:14.513 line:0%
[ Booing ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:16.682 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-The American Rescue Plan

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:18.317 line:0%
helped working people.

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:21.053
-It's like every white guy
at a hip hop show.

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:22.788
[ Laughter ]
"You're clapping

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:24.958
on the ones and threes,
Richard!"

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.292
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.393
During President Biden's

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.928
State of the Union address
last night,

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.765
several members of Congress
wore blue and yellow

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.232
in solidarity with Ukraine,

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:36.069
though I'm not sure everybody
understood the assignment.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:39.539
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.707
During last night's speech,

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.909
Republican Congresswomen
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.377
and Lauren Boebert heckled
and booed President Biden

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:46.412
on several occasions.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.048
In their defense,
he is, technically,

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.482
the manager.

00:00:50.482 --> 00:00:52.452
[ Hesitant laughter ]

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.656
And that, technically,
was a joke.

00:00:57.656 --> 00:00:59.626
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.296
Technically.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.264
[ Laughter ]
During President Biden's

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:06.766
State of the Union address
last night,

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.769
he accidentally said "Iranian,"
instead of "Ukrainian."

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.671
[ Laughter ]
Well,

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.074
in a speech where he had
to pronounce Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:18.377
and Ketanji Brown Jackson,
something had to give.

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:21.047
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.949
According to a new poll,
71% of Americans

00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:26.352
who watched President Biden's
State of the Union address

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.287
had a positive reaction
to the speech,

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.757
but let's be honest --
everyone who would've had

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.159
a negative reaction
was watching "Yellowstone."

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.561
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:36.695
According to a new survey,

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:38.664
New York has the highest
median rent price

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:40.633
for a one-bedroom apartment
in the country.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:43.536
Well, yeah, but it's all
about location, location...

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.772
[ Train screeching, rumbling ]

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.707
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:48.608
...location.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.477
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:52.011
And, finally,
Major League Baseball

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.345
announced yesterday
that they are

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:55.815
postponing their
March 31st Opening Day

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.483
and canceling
the first two series

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.251
of regular season baseball,

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:01.721
after the league could not reach
a bargaining agreement

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.990
with its players' union,
which is bad news for the Mets

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.994
because the regular season is
the only one they got.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:08.995
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:10.897
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

